# Docker build context = this directory (court-booking-frontend/) for
# apps/web/Dockerfile. Keep host-installed and generated state OUT of it so a
# local build sees exactly what a clean CI checkout sees. Without this, COPY
# apps/web swept in the host's untracked apps/web/node_modules, which is what
# let a broken Dockerfile (missing nested node_modules) build fine locally and
# fail only in CI. See the builder-stage comment in apps/web/Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.gitignore
